          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: An amateur photographer discovers unexpected objects in his photographs taken in burst mode during a weekend in Biarritz. This case is a posteriori observation of strange objects on a photo, with nothing noticed visually. It's a typical case of a small object passing very close to the camera. In this case, it was spray that caused the furtive spots. It can be assumed that birds are also visible in the distance.",
